---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="about">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

    <p>
      <em>apocryphal</em> — texts of disputed origin, outside the accepted canon.
    </p>

    <p>
      This is the personal blog of Alex, founder of
      <a href="https://divergentflow.io">DivergentFlow, PBC</a>.
      I write about technology, consciousness, history, music, and the spaces
      between disciplines where the interesting things happen.
    </p>

    <p>
      I was a techno-optimist in the early 90s. I was big into Scheme and PL theory,
      a fan of Timothy C. May and the cypherpunks, and had a respectable geek code.
      In some ways, the work I'm doing now is a way of getting back to the days
      before surveillance capitalism and the techno-barons ruined everything.
    </p>

    <p>
      This site has no tracking, no cookies, and no surveillance.
      There is an <a href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a>.
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .page-title {
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .about {
      max-width: var(--content-width);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
